Deosil is a neighborhood of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It is inland, with no direct connection to the river, and its industry is mostly factories turning out home appliances and toys rather than the docks of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]] and [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]]. It has little housing and little service trade.

A man named Lark sells guns in Deosil marked with [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]] tokens.

A factory at 414 Anchor Street, registered under the name of [[People/Sbrtlby Jotes|Sbrtlby Jotes]], was the front for his drug ring: one part a single-floor warehouse and one part two floors. Sbrtlby and his henchmen are dead, and the works have been brought down. The building folded in on itself and damaged nothing around it.
